Yeah... don't know whether this is a bug or a feature, though.  My pet
seems to pick up cursed objects only when he's moved onto the square
to eat something (like a monster I've killed).  The positive stimulus
of fresh food seems to override the negative stimulus of a cursed
object.  (Normally, of course, pets will not walk over anything cursed.)
Is this a devilish feature intended to counter overconfident nethackers
who've been reading too many spoilers?  Or is it a particularly annoying
bug?  Only Frobozz knows, and Frobozz ain't talking.

